v 3
d 'ORTHOPSI': Post-procedure complications after orthopaedic surgery from ICD-9-CM and ICD-10-CM codes
d
d Flags 15 categories of post-procedure complications (patient safety
d indicators), plus device-related infections, after orthopaedic surgery
d from ICD-9-CM and ICD-10-CM diagnosis codes,
d with site-specific codes applied only to the relevant procedure types
d (spine, hip, knee, upper and lower extremity, foot, hand).
d
d Requires Stata 16 or later.
d
d Author: Brook I. Martin, PhD, MPH
d Department of Orthopaedics, University of Utah
d Support: Brook.Martin@hsc.utah.edu
d
d Version 2.1
d Distribution-Date: 20261106
d
f orthopsi.ado
f orthopsi.sthlp
F orthopsi_codes.csv
f orthopsi_test.do
